1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,080
Woman: Hello, I'm calling about an order I placed two weeks ago. It still hasn't arrived.

2
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:10,340
Man: I'm sorry about that. Could you give me your order number?

3
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:14,810
Woman: It's four, seven, two, nine, one.

4
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:19,470
Man: Thank you. I can see the parcel was sent to your old address.

5
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:22,940
Woman: But I updated my address in my account last month!

6
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:30,600
Man: You're right, and I apologise. I'll send a new parcel today by express delivery, free of charge.

7
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,120
Woman: Thank you. Will I get a tracking number?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,720
Man: Yes, you'll receive it by email within an hour.

